#~ msgid ""
#~ "CWA is configured so that your Calibre Database (<code>metadata.db</code> "
#~ "file) should always be somewhere in <code>/calibre-library</code>.\n"
#~ "        CWA automatically searches whatever directory you've bound to "
#~ "<code>/calibre-library</code> in your docker-compose file for existing "
#~ "Calibre\n"
#~ "        Libraries/metadata.db files on start up. If it finds just one "
#~ "existing library, it mounts it automatically, if it find multiple, by "
#~ "default\n"
#~ "        it will mount the largest one automatically and if it doesn't "
#~ "find any, it will automatically create and mount a new one. For more "
#~ "details,\n"
#~ "        <a href=\"https://github.com/crocodilestick/Calibre-Web-Automated/"
#~ "wiki/Configuration#database-configuration\">see here</a>!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "CWA 的配置方式是，您的 Calibre 数据库（<code>metadata.db</code> 文件）应始"
#~ "终位于 <code>/calibre-library</code> 中的某个位置。\n"
#~ "CWA 会在启动时自动搜索您在 docker-compose 文件中绑定到 <code>/calibre-"
#~ "library</code> 的目录，查找现有的 Calibre 库/metadata.db 文件。\n"
#~ "如果仅找到一个现有库，它会自动挂载；如果找到多个，按默认设置它会自动挂载最"
#~ "大的那个；如果一个都没有找到，它会自动创建并挂载一个新的。\n"
#~ "更多详情，请<a href=\"https://github.com/crocodilestick/Calibre-Web-"
#~ "Automated/wiki/Configuration#database-configuration\">点击此处查看</a>！"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Therefore, when configuring your docker-compose file for CWA, <b>DO NOT "
#~ "CHANGE THE PATHS IN THE VOLUMES SECTION ON THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE COLONS!</"
#~ "b>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因此，在为 CWA 配置您的 docker-compose 文件时，<b>切勿更改冒号右侧“卷”中的"
#~ "路径！</b>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "These paths are internal to CWA only, you can change what they're bind to "
#~ "to your heart's content on the left-hand side but there's no reason to\n"
#~ "        change the paths on the right-hand side.<br><br>If you would like "
#~ "your <code>metadata.db</code> file in a different location to the rest of "
#~ "your\n"
#~ "        library, use the <b>Separate Book Files from Library Option below "
#~ "and there, enter the path to the rest of the library</b>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这些路径仅在 CWA 内部使用，您可以在左侧随意更改它们绑定的内容，但没有理由"
#~ "更改右侧的路径。\n"
#~ "<br><br>如果您希望将 <code>metadata.db</code> 文件放在与您的库其余部分不同"
#~ "的位置，\n"
#~ "请使用下面的“将书籍文件与库分离”选项，在那里输入库其余部分的路径"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "E.g. As long as your library's <code>metadata.db</code> file is bound "
#~ "somewhere within <code>/calibre-library</code>, you could bind the dir\n"
#~ "        containing the corresponding book files ect. to something like "
#~ "<code>/books</code> and enter <code>/books</code> in the field that pops "
#~ "up below\n"
#~ "        once you've checked the <b>Separate Book Files from Library</b> "
#~ "option."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "例如：只要您的图书馆的 <code>metadata.db</code> 文件位于 <code>/calibre-"
#~ "library</code> 目录内的某个位置，您就可以将包含相应书籍文件等的目录绑定到"
#~ "例如 <code>/books</code> 这样的位置，并在弹出的下方输入框中输入 <code>/"
#~ "books</code>，然后勾选 <b>将书籍文件与图书馆分离</b> 选项即可。"

#~ msgid "Split Library Functionality"
#~ msgstr "拆分库功能"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<b>Separate Book Files from Library</b> - <code>metadata.db</code> file "
#~ "should remain in <code>/calibre-library</code>, however your library "
#~ "files can be wherever you desire"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<b>将书本文件与图书馆分离</b> - <code>metadata.db</code> 文件应保留在 "
#~ "<code>/calibre-library</code> 目录中，但您的图书馆文件可以存放在您所希望的"
#~ "任何位置"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If your Calibre library is corrupted and cannot be opened, you can "
#~ "attempt to restore it from the OPF files in your library. This will "
#~ "<b>erase all per-book data</b> (reading progress, bookmarks, shelf links, "
#~ "downloads, etc.) in the app database, but will not affect user accounts "
#~ "or settings. <b>Both databases will be automatically backed up in /config/"
#~ "backup before any destructive action.</b> A restore log will be saved "
#~ "alongside the backups."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果您的 Calibre 数据库已损坏且无法打开，您可以尝试从数据库中的 OPF 文件中"
#~ "恢复它。这样做会<b>删除应用程序数据库中的所有每本书的数据</b>（阅读进度、"
#~ "书签、书架链接、下载记录等），但不会影响用户账户或设置。<b>在执行任何破坏"
#~ "性操作之前，两个数据库都会自动在 /config/backup 目录下进行备份。</b>同时还"
#~ "会保存一个恢复日志作为备份的一部分。"

